  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Ecopark Smart City ICT Infrastructure, through Information Services Group Americas, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a technical assistance for Ecopark Corporation, a commercial land developer in Vietnam, to optimize the ICT infrastructure for Ecopark, a smart city community outside of Hanoi. The technical assistance will help Ecopark Corporation deploy the ICT infrastructure needed to build a sustainable and connected community enabled by cutting-edge smart city technologies and solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
